 Certified project is also known for its exclusive array of amenities required to experience an exceptional lifestyle. Kids play area, gym, swimming pool and indoor games room are just few of the amenities made available for residents.  \n  \nHighpoints  \n  \nThe location is another highlight of Rustomjee Elanza as Marve Road, Link Road, temple, college, school, garden and playground are all close by. Furthermore, the project is well connected to all the parts of the city. [...] Rustomjee Elanza by Rustomjee Developers is located in the Malad West, Mumbai. Built across 3 towers, Rustomjee Elanza offers a total of 456 units comprising of spacious 2 BHK and 2.5 BHK abodes spanning across an area of 1100 sqft and 1350 sqft respectively. The abodes are up for sale immediately. Rustomjee Elanza at Malad West, Mumbai, offers high-end yet affordable apartment options ranging between INR 2.30 Cr. - 2.99 Cr..  \n  \nProject details  \n  \nAll 3 of its towers are constructed on an elevated land at a height of 160 meters, earning the designation of being one of the tallest buildings in Mumbai while enjoying staggering views of the city. The average rate is set at Rs. 19,923 to Rs. 26,244 per sqft but the amount may vary depending upon the total area of construction.","score":0.8003337,"raw_content":null,"id":"d27abc-02"},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/rustomjee-elanza-malad-west_mumbai-prjt-5bac1ede714b564981dc9164","title":"Rustomjee Elanza, Malad west: Price, Photos & Floor Plan","content":"Rustomjee Elanza, situated in Malad West, combines the charm of Western Mumbai with modern amenities and security features, offering a luxurious and comfortable living environment.\n\n## Amenities at Rustomjee Elanza\n\nRustomjee Elanza in Malad West offers a modern living experience with a blend of comfort and style. This premium property offers a range of amenities designed to cater to every need, ensuring residents enjoy a vibrant and fulfilling life in Malad West. Here’s a look at the features and amenities: [...] The property in Western Mumbai has several lifestyle amenities that cater to the diverse needs of residents, from fitness facilities to community spaces. These amenities are thoughtfully integrated to promote a balanced lifestyle, making Malad West an even more desirable place to live. With its strategic location in Malad West and a range of thoughtfully designed amenities, Rustomjee Elanza delivers an unparalleled living experience that blends luxury, comfort, and convenience.\n\n## Rustomjee Elanza Location Advantages [...] ## Rustomjee Elanza Location Advantages\n\nRustomjee Elanza, Malad West is a premium residential project in the heart of Western Mumbai, offering modern and luxurious living in western Mumbai. Designed to meet the needs of urban families, this project features fully furnished apartments with top-notch amenities. The area’s connectivity in Western Mumbai, infrastructure, and lifestyle options make it a popular choice for homebuyers seeking a well-rounded living experience in the western suburbs.\n\n### Accessibility\n\nRustomjee Elanza is situated in one of the most sought-after localities, Malad West in Western Mumbai, known for its seamless connectivity and vibrant lifestyle.","score":0.79958355,"raw_content":null,"id":"f3128f-03"},{"url":"https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/2-bhk-apartment-for-sale-in-rustomjee-elanza-malad-west-mumbai-41487-pdp","title":"2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Rustomjee Elanza Malad West, Mumbai","content":"The project features sports-centric amenities, including Swimming Pool, Jogging / Cycle Track. What lifestyle amenities are offered at 2 BHK","score":0.79522943,"raw_content":null,"id":"8cf77c-04"},{"url":"https://www.slideserve.com/mumbaiproperty/rustomjee-elanza-malad-mumbai-affinityconsultant-com","title":"rustomjee elanza malad mumbai \"affinityconsultant.com\" - SlideServe","content":"Rustomjee Elanza offers 2, 2.5 BHK apartment with world class amenities and infrastructure. Rustom